WEBVTT

00:22:27.444 --> 00:22:30.442
you know, you've got
to break it down as to what it is.

00:22:30.466 --> 00:22:35.158
Is it sensible cause-effect relationships
that are being dealt with?

00:22:36.212 --> 00:22:39.855
It all comes back
to "Do you have understanding,

00:22:39.879 --> 00:22:45.227
and are you successfully betting
on a cause-effect relationship?"

00:22:45.251 --> 00:22:49.038
Because that's the only way
you're going to make money.

00:22:49.062 --> 00:22:52.712
But the computer can do it,
process that thing,

00:22:52.736 --> 00:22:54.522
in a much more advanced way.

00:22:54.546 --> 00:22:56.584
So that's what's going on.

00:22:56.608 --> 00:22:57.770
There will be people

00:22:57.794 --> 00:23:01.670
who will make the mistake
of just applying machine learning